{"4314870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Infinite Crosswalk", "steam_appid": 4314870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4814010], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Crosswalk is a psychedelic walking simulator and horror game in old-school 3D aesthetics. Low-poly streets and a psychedelic atmosphere await you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4314870/extras/4980dee776a7d3cccad4cc1e3726637e.poster.avif?t=1781604232\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4314870/extras/4980dee776a7d3cccad4cc1e3726637e.webm?t=1781604232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4314870/extras/4980dee776a7d3cccad4cc1e3726637e.mp4?t=1781604232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in an endless limbo — a distorted version of the very crosswalk where you were hit by a car. To escape, you need to talk to other victims, collect fragments of their final moments and accurately reconstruct how they died.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4314870/extras/1b310d22bdcaf4faa031eb0ec0deb666.poster.avif?t=1781604232\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4314870/extras/1b310d22bdcaf4faa031eb0ec0deb666.webm?t=1781604232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4314870/extras/1b310d22bdcaf4faa031eb0ec0deb666.mp4?t=1781604232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this limbo does not tolerate mistakes. A wrong answer — and reality begins to slowly tear you apart: your vision fades, blood appears in your lungs, the screen shakes, and your body fails. Every mistake is felt <strong>physically.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow, atmospheric walking simulator with emphasis on exploration and dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychedelic horror with black humor and growing sense of dread.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consequence system: gradual loss of organs that affects gameplay perception and gives a chance to reroll with a dice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Road survival: walk, dodge cars, and catch safe moments at traffic lights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to cross this infinite crosswalk again and again… until you find the way out?&quot;</strong><br> </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Crosswalk is a psychedelic walking simulator and horror game in old-school 3D aesthetics. Low-poly streets and a psychedelic atmosphere await you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4314870/extras/4980dee776a7d3cccad4cc1e3726637e.poster.avif?t=1781604232\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4314870/extras/4980dee776a7d3cccad4cc1e3726637e.webm?t=1781604232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4314870/extras/4980dee776a7d3cccad4cc1e3726637e.mp4?t=1781604232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in an endless limbo — a distorted version of the very crosswalk where you were hit by a car. To escape, you need to talk to other victims, collect fragments of their final moments and accurately reconstruct how they died.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4314870/extras/1b310d22bdcaf4faa031eb0ec0deb666.poster.avif?t=1781604232\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4314870/extras/1b310d22bdcaf4faa031eb0ec0deb666.webm?t=1781604232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4314870/extras/1b310d22bdcaf4faa031eb0ec0deb666.mp4?t=1781604232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this limbo does not tolerate mistakes. A wrong answer — and reality begins to slowly tear you apart: your vision fades, blood appears in your lungs, the screen shakes, and your body fails. Every mistake is felt <strong>physically.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow, atmospheric walking simulator with emphasis on exploration and dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychedelic horror with black humor and growing sense of dread.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consequence system: gradual loss of organs that affects gameplay perception and gives a chance to reroll with a dice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Road survival: walk, dodge cars, and catch safe moments at traffic lights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to cross this infinite crosswalk again and again… until you find the way out?&quot;</strong><br> </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Infinite Crosswalk is a psychedelic walking simulator and horror game in retro 3D style. You get hit on a zebra crossing and trapped in limbo. Uncover the victims' tragic stories to escape — or pay with parts of your own body.", "supported_languages": "Eng